      "content": "Details of Kshethram:\nMoolavar: Purushottaman\nThayaar: Purushottama Nayaki\nVimanam: Sanjeevinigrah Vimanam\nPushkarani: Tiruparkadal Theertham\n\nTravel: This kshethram is located 8 km from Sirkazhi.\n\nAzhwar Pasuram: \nTirumangai Azhwar – 10 Pasurams\n",
